25,2,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
26,2,,status,Rin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
27,2,,status,Shion,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
28,2,,status,Mizuki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
29,2,,status,Yumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
30,2,1,talk,Rin,,"It takes a few minutes to get set up every morning, and people arrive at totally different times!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The floor billing is based on area, not people, and re-running power for each desk is surprisingly expensive.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"People really want windows, and we've had a lot of disruptive, unplanned shuffles recently.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Shion,,"The noise levels vary quite a bit across the room, and it takes a long time to get a workstation's ergonomics just right.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Yumi,,Sitting near each other really helps with quick answers and helps new people learn the ropes just by listening!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Rin,,"If we change seats all the time, those few minutes of setup every single morning are going to add up and waste our time!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"And if we keep shifting the layout, those facilities charges for power and network will keep draining our limited budget.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"We can't just ignore the fact that some spots are objectively worse, and frequent unplanned shuffles only make that unfairness more chaotic.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Shion,,"Exactly. If we move around too much, we lose the physical comfort we've spent days adjusting, and we might end up stuck in the noisy areas.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"But if we stay in fixed spots, we might miss out on those natural conversations that make working together so much easier!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Rin,,"I just don't think we can afford to lose that time every day, especially when our schedules are already so tight!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Toshio,,We need a solution that minimizes recurring costs and avoids unnecessary technical changes to the floor.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"We should avoid any system that leaves the ""bad"" seats to be decided by luck or habit, as that's just not fair.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Shion,,I'm with Mizuki; a system that forces us to constantly reset our ergonomics or gamble on noise levels is a non-starter for me.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Yumi,,I just feel like we're focusing so much on the downsides of moving that we're forgetting how much we gain when we actually talk to each other!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm just worried that if we don't think about the daily grind, we'll pick something that sounds great but feels exhausting!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Toshio,,Stability is the only way to ensure we don't bleed money on facilities and billing for space we aren't using efficiently.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"We need a layout that is transparent and stable, so we don't end up with the same people stuck in the worst spots.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,Shion,,I agree. We need a plan that prioritizes physical stability and comfort over a novelty that disrupts our focus and our bodies.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Yumi,,"I just want us to find a way to keep that team spirit and easy communication alive, no matter where we sit!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
