55,3,1,talk,Rin,,"Looking at the options, Free Address seems like a nightmare for my schedule and the morning rush!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Rotating Blocks would be too costly given the facilities quotes, so I'm leaning toward Fixed Desks by Function.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Fixed Desks by Function seems the most fair, as it allows us to openly decide the layout and avoid the chaos of unplanned shuffles.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Shion,,Fixed Desks by Function is the only choice that lets me keep my ergonomics and avoid the noise of the corridor.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Yumi,,"I see why you all like Fixed Desks, but I'm worried we'll lose that spontaneous magic if we're too separated by function!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Rin,,I guess Fixed Desks is better than wasting ten minutes every morning just to find a place to plug in!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"It's the most fiscally responsible choice, as it prevents the recurring costs associated with frequent layout changes.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,It also means we can finally address the window situation and make sure the distribution of seats is handled consciously.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Shion,,It's the only way to ensure I don't have to spend days readjusting my chair and monitor every time we rotate.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"I still think we're missing out on the social side, but if everyone else is this worried about the stress, I'll go with Fixed Desks too.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Rin,,I'm sold on Fixed Desks by Function; it's the only way to keep my morning gaps from disappearing!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I'll vote for Fixed Desks by Function to keep our costs predictable and our infrastructure stable.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I'll vote for Fixed Desks by Function to ensure we have a fair, transparent arrangement that doesn't rely on luck.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Shion,,I'll vote for Fixed Desks by Function to protect my focus and my physical health.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Yumi,,"I'll vote for Fixed Desks by Function too, since it seems like the only way we'll all be happy!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
